LOCATION:NOIR café\, Graefestraße 82\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: NOIRCAFÉ Saturday Dinner Menue \nStandard Menue\n\n L
 a Milonguita Nota Negra \n----------\nThe darker the night\, the sweeter t
 he dance.\n- Entrée 2 € - donations welcome\nAperitif - 18:00 -19:00\n\
 n- PRACTICA\nStarter\nA taste of tango walking\, seasoned with rhythm — 
 exploring which steps and styles pair best with each piece of music.\n\nA 
 first sip of rhythm- a slow awakening for the senses\nMain Course - 19:00 
 - 22:00\n\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra\nA rich blend of Argentine classics an
 d hidden gems\, carefully seasoned by \n- DJ mojokojo\, \n\nBest enjoyed w
 ith drinks\, served alongside with tempting bites \;)…\n\nLean in. Let t
 he night melt on your tongue\, each step a lingering bite of dark chocolat
 e\, each glance a sip of red wine\, let your steps follow the flavor of th
 e music. \n\nNOIRcafé\, Graefestraße 82\n10967 Berlin\n----------\nQuell
 e: https://www.facebook.com/philip.kojo.96\n\nVeranstalter: Philip Kojo \n
 \nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/492860/La-Milonguita-Nota-
